Cypress Lakes Utilities, Inc. in Polk County (WS800); 
Utilities, Inc. of Eagle Ridge in Lee County (SU749); 
Utilities, Inc. of Florida in Marion (SU661), Orange (WU413), Pasco (SU640) and (WU372), Pinellas (WU628), and Seminole  (WS251) Counties; 
Labrador Utilities, Inc.  Pasco County (WS851); 
Lake Placid Utilities, Inc. in Highlands County (WS709); 
Lake Utility Services, Inc. in Lake County (WS641 and WU553); 
Utilities, Inc. of Longwood in Seminole County (SU761); 
Mid-County Services, Inc. in Pinellas County SU291); 
Utilities, Inc. of Pennbrooke in Lake County (WS861); 
Utilities, Inc. of Sandalhaven in Charlotte County (SU959); 
Sanlando Utilities Corporation in Seminole County (WS397); 
Tierra Verde Utilities, Inc. in Pinellas County (SU682), to Utilities, Inc. of Florida; 

Cancels certificates held by: 
WS861 – Utilities, Inc. of Pennbrooke – Certificates 400-S and 466-W; 
WS851 – Labrador Utilities – Certificates 530-S and 616-W; 
SU682 – Tierra Verde Utilities, Inc. - Certificate 58-S; 
WS397 – Sanlando Utilities Corporation – Certificates 189-S and 247-W; 
SU761 – Utilities, Inc. of Longwood – Certificate 232-S 

Certificates amended for additional territory: 
WS641 and WU553 - Certificates 465-S  and 496-W territory from WS861; 
SU291 – Certificate 081-S territory from SU682; 
SU640 and WU372 – Certificates 229-S and 107-W territory from WS851; 
WS251 – Certificates 225-S, 278-W territory from WS397 and SU761, respectively. 
All name changes, amendments and cancellations of certificates effective 4-12-16 as stated in order. 

3/1/21 - Contact information updated per Change of Company Contact Information Form #308. –dm 

